Homepage: https://github.com/ishworrsubedii/SitBlinkSip
Description: Background eye-blink tracker with break, posture and water reminders
 SitBlinkSip Desktop watches for eye blinks, posture and time-since-last-water-
 break through the webcam and a timer, without displaying the camera feed by
 default. If your blink rate drops below a healthy minimum over a rolling
 minute, the screen blanks briefly to prompt you to blink; slouching and long
 stretches without water trigger a sound + notification instead. Press F6 (or
 use the tray menu) to reveal the live camera preview on demand.
